## Goal
See how the six samples in this project cluster: a principal component analysis (PCA) of the
gene-level counts, with each sample coloured by its `condition` (untreated: A1, A2, A3;
treated: B1, B2, B3). The analysis produces the ordination and the variance each component
explains. Reading what the clustering means is left to the user.

